# Only the three empty seed fixtures are tracked. Everything else that lands
# in this directory at runtime must never enter git:
#
#   auth.json          the admin password hash
#   .salt              the key that makes the stored IP hashes meaningful --
#                      committing it would let anyone with the repo reverse
#                      every hashed address back
#   *.lock, *.tmp      transient
#   stats/reports/ratelimit/attempts/ipinfo data, once non-empty
#
# DATA_DIR now defaults to a directory *outside* the web root (see
# ../config.php), so this directory is only used if someone deliberately
# points DATA_DIR back here.
*
!.gitignore
!.htaccess
!announcements.json
!stats.json
!version.json
